 See [ownership contracts](../../../SCOPES.md) for durable worker setup, serialization,
 closing order and administrative reconciliation.
+
+## Certificate-authenticated gateways
+
+Install `runengine[openshell]` with OpenShell SDK 0.0.104 or newer. Configure
+`OpenShellRunnerConfig(tls=OpenShellTLSConfig(ca_path="ca.crt",
+cert_path="client.crt", key_path="client.key"), ...)` for a gateway requiring
+client certificates. Certificate and key paths must be supplied together; paths
+refer to files on the dispatcher, not private key contents or receiver files.
+The adapter translates these portable values to the SDK TLS configuration for
+both ordinary invocations and retained environments. Omitted TLS configuration
+preserves the previous wire shape and SDK constructor call.
